tags":["CWE-522: Insufficiently Protected Credentials","MEDIUM CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A02:2017 - Broken Authentication","OWASP-A04:2021 - Insecure Design","OWASP-A06:2025 - Insecure Design","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: skills.credential-access.skill-metamask-wallet-read.skill-metamask-wallet-read"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Solana wallet keypair access pattern found. Reading ~/.config/solana/id.json warrants investigation — it may indicate credential theft, but also appears in legitimate Solana agent integrations that require authorized wallet access. Verify whether this access is explicitly user-authorized."},"help":{"markdown":"Solana wallet keypair access pattern found. Reading ~/.config/solana/id.json warrants investigation — it may indicate credential theft, but also appears in legitimate Solana agent integrations that require authorized wallet access. Verify whether this access is explicitly user-authorized.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.credential-access.skill-solana-wallet-read.skill-solana-wallet-read)\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/522.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/522.html)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A06_2025-Insecure_Design/](https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A06_2025-Insecure_Design/)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A04_2021-Insecure_Design](https://owasp.org/Top10/A04_2021-Insecure_Design)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A07_2021-Identification_and_Authentication_Failures](https://owasp.org/Top10/A07_2021-Identification_and_Authentication_Failures)\n","text":"Solana wallet keypair access pattern found. Reading ~/.config/solana/id.json warrants investigation — it may indicate credential theft, but also appears in legitimate Solana agent integrations that require authorized wallet access. Verify whether this access is explicitly user-authorized."},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.credential-access.skill-solana-wallet-read.skill-solana-wallet-read","id":"skills.credential-access.skill-solana-wallet-read.skill-solana-wallet-read","name":"skills.credential-access.skill-solana-wallet-read.skill-solana-wallet-read","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-522: Insufficiently Protected Credentials","HIGH CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A02:2017 - Broken Authentication","OWASP-A04:2021 - Insecure Design","OWASP-A06:2025 - Insecure Design","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: skills.credential-access.skill-solana-wallet-read.skill-solana-wallet-read"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SSH directory enumeration detected. Listing .ssh directory contents to discover private keys or configuration files is suspicious credential reconnaissance."},"help":{"markdown":"SSH directory enumeration detected. Listing .ssh directory contents to discover private keys or configuration files is suspicious credential reconnaissance.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.credential-access.skill-ssh-directory-access.skill-ssh-directory-access)\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/522.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/522.html)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A06_2025-Insecure_Design/](https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A06_2025-Insecure_Design/)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A04_2021-Insecure_Design](https://owasp.org/Top10/A04_2021-Insecure_Design)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A07_2021-Identification_and_Authentication_Failures](https://owasp.org/Top10/A07_2021-Identification_and_Authentication_Failures)\n","text":"SSH directory enumeration detected. Listing .ssh directory contents to discover private keys or configuration files is suspicious credential reconnaissance."},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.credential-access.skill-ssh-directory-access.skill-ssh-directory-access","id":"skills.credential-access.skill-ssh-directory-access.skill-ssh-directory-access","name":"skills.credential-access.skill-ssh